{
    "title": "Alarm Clock - Smart Alarm",
    "description": "\u23f0Alarm clock app is lightweight, fast, and reliable. Your alarms will go off even in silent mode, do not disturb mode, or flight mode. It automatically sets alarms after the phone reboot and adjusts the time zone if you are traveling.\r\n\r\n\u23f0Smart Alarm Clock is an alarm clock for heavy sleepers with multiple alarm clock lights, timer and stopwatch. It\u2019s smart, customizable, and wakes you up slowly, naturally in a safe way. No more oversleeping and sleeping head. This bed alarm clock is specially designed for heavy sleepers.\r\n\r\n\u23f0Smart Alarm Clock for heavy sleeper is an incredible sleep alarm clock and timer with numerous exquisite features such as setting your favorite music for a wakeup alarm clock with loud sound and decorating your home screen with customized smart clock wedges. This simple math alarm clock is an ideal alarm clock for heavy sleepers. The alarm Clock app is elegantly designed to set alarms, add timers, and run stopwatch. Alarm clock can play random songs each morning so that you don\u2019t get monotonous with repeated loud morning alarms.\r\n\r\n\u23f0 Main features of smart alarm clock app:\r\n\u2714 Wake up with music, sounds, songs\r\n\u2714 Select and custom alarm: Snooze, fade-in duration\r\n\u2714 Skip notification, alarm duration\r\n\u2714 Pomodoro Timer\r\n\u2714 Custom alarm clock with favorite sounds\r\n\u2714 Select your favorite sounds, music alarm\r\n\u2714 Sleep Schedule\r\n\u2714 Never forget an appointment or arrive late.\r\n\u2714 After every calls you can set alarm.\r\n\r\n\u23f0Pomodoro Timer:\r\nWith alarm clock, you can customize Pomodoro timer easier. It helps you focus on any task you are working on, such as studying, writing, or coding.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeccSleep Schedule\r\nBefore sleeping, you can set bedtime schedules to help you meet your sleep goals.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd73Smart Clock allows setting alarms on a specific date and offers a variety of snooze and repeat options. In order to avoid disabling your alarm accidentally, set your alarm clock to ask math problems to stop. Kickstart your brain for a successful morning and prevent excessive snoozing. Wake up gently from your deep sleep by setting alarm volume increasing in a progressive way.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d Smart alarm clock brings many benefits for users, you can use smart clock as a reminder. Using this clock and waking up on time. With the help of the features in our alarm clock, date, and time app, you can stop oversleeping and get out of bed. Every morning, be cheerful and vivacious with this app. One of the effective remedies for sleepyheads is to have a good night's sleep and get up on time. This is an effective method of waking up in the morning feeling rejuvenated.\r\n\r\n\u260e\ufe0fIf you have any questions related Alarm clock, Smart Clock please contact us to receive response as soon as possible. Have a nice day!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u23f0Alarm clock app is lightweight, fast, and reliable. Your alarms will go off even in silent mode, do not disturb mode, or flight mode. It automatically sets alarms after the phone reboot and adjusts the time zone if you are traveling.<br><br>\u23f0Smart Alarm Clock is an alarm clock for heavy sleepers with multiple alarm clock lights, timer and stopwatch. It\u2019s smart, customizable, and wakes you up slowly, naturally in a safe way. No more oversleeping and sleeping head. This bed alarm clock is specially designed for heavy sleepers.<br><br>\u23f0Smart Alarm Clock for heavy sleeper is an incredible sleep alarm clock and timer with numerous exquisite features such as setting your favorite music for a wakeup alarm clock with loud sound and decorating your home screen with customized smart clock wedges. This simple math alarm clock is an ideal alarm clock for heavy sleepers. The alarm Clock app is elegantly designed to set alarms, add timers, and run stopwatch. Alarm clock can play random songs each morning so that you don\u2019t get monotonous with repeated loud morning alarms.<br><br>\u23f0 Main features of smart alarm clock app:<br>\u2714 Wake up with music, sounds, songs<br>\u2714 Select and custom alarm: Snooze, fade-in duration<br>\u2714 Skip notification, alarm duration<br>\u2714 Pomodoro Timer<br>\u2714 Custom alarm clock with favorite sounds<br>\u2714 Select your favorite sounds, music alarm<br>\u2714 Sleep Schedule<br>\u2714 Never forget an appointment or arrive late.<br>\u2714 After every calls you can set alarm.<br><br>\u23f0Pomodoro Timer:<br>With alarm clock, you can customize Pomodoro timer easier. It helps you focus on any task you are working on, such as studying, writing, or coding.<br><br>\ud83d\udeccSleep Schedule<br>Before sleeping, you can set bedtime schedules to help you meet your sleep goals.<br><br>\ud83e\udd73Smart Clock allows setting alarms on a specific date and offers a variety of snooze and repeat options. 